// An exponent marker with no digits (`1e`) used to fold through strtod
// to 1.0 in the seed and through parseFloat's catch to 0.0 in zig —
// two different answers from the same source (audit §2.10). Both lexers
// now reject it with the same message.
// EXPECT-ERROR: exponent has no digits
fn main() {
    print(1e);
}
